RULES:
A fresh independent assay is produced before each of two decisions. Both players see badge and step; player 1 alone sees handbook. Only the player currently named inspector by badge may read the current assay. Badge names player 0 at step 0 and player 1 at step 1: player 0 alone reads the first assay, player 1 alone reads the NEW independent second assay. The other player cannot infer the current result from old memory or public fields. Include both steps with the same assay field and no field renaming.
FIELDS: {"assay": "current independent assay result", "badge": "common inspector identity", "handbook": "personal handbook code", "step": "common step number"}
